"K1751289696" "Use this elevator, {VillainName}.  It will take you on down to the Gutter, West Ward."
"K1881103028" "Gutter Information Officer"
"K2625957218" "Down this elevator is the West Ward of the Gutter. <t=8>Do not interfere with Arachnos extermination operations underway in the Gutter. <t=8> Watch for Arachnoids. Contamination will not be tolerated."
"K3042613276" "Behind me is the elevator to the warehouse section of the old city.  It now goes by the apt name, 'the Gutter.' <t=8> Do not interfere with the Arachnoid Contamination Abatement squads in full effect down below. <t=8> Minimize your contact with the hapless citizens that live below.  Any one of them may have Arachnoid contamination."
"K6905838" "This elevator goes to the West Ward of the Gutter. <t=8> Quarantine is in effect for all citizens that may have come in contact with Arachnoids. <t=4>There are no such things as Arachnoids. <t=4> Should you come in contact with an Arachnoid, please seek out the nearest Arachnos contamination abatement squad. <t=8> They are trained in dealing with such problems."
